  "question": {
    "text": "The velocity and acceleration of a point-like body at the initial moment of its motion are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;respectively. The acceleration vector of the body remains constant. The minimum radius of curvature of the trajectory of the body is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0021277_queCA_1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 62px;\" />",
    "image": null
